// Deal or Force - what the world already thought of itself on 1 January 2024.
//
// 00_pacts.json is what was signed; this is what was felt. Without it the scenario opened on
// countries that had never met: India and Pakistan neutral, Iran and Israel neutral, the two
// Koreas neutral - and the computer, finding nothing between them, signed them into alliances.
//
//     rivalries     an old enmity (opinion modifier `historic_rivalry`, -45 unless the row
//                   says otherwise). Two countries it leaves at or below AiRivalryThreshold
//                   open as rivals.
//     friendships   an old friendship (`historic_friendship`, +30 unless the row says).
//
// Both fade over fifty years. `why` is for whoever reads this file; nothing reads it in the
// game. Only standing, well-known relationships are here - not every quarrel of 2023 - and a
// mod that wants a different world ships its own file beside this one.
